  "contentHtml": "<div style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; font-family:inherit; line-height:1.7;\">\n<p>  <!-- Dateline bar --></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; padding:28px 0 36px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.15); margin-bottom:36px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:0.68em; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.18em; opacity:0.4; margin-bottom:8px;\">Week of March 30–5, 2026</div>\n<div style=\"opacity:0.35; font-size:0.8em;\">📡 Curated from 13 sources &nbsp;·&nbsp; Ranked by community signal</div>\n</p></div>\n<p>  <!-- Jump nav --></p>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:44px; padding:16px 20px; background:rgba(0,3,56,0.4); border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.1);\">\n<div style=\"font-size:0.68em; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.12em; opacity:0.4; margin-bottom:12px;\">Jump to:</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px;\"><a href=\"#whats-new\" style=\"color:#8EF2FE; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.76em; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.28); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; opacity:0.8;\">🔥 Releases</a><a href=\"#business\" style=\"color:#8EF2FE; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.76em; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.28); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; opacity:0.8;\">💼 Business</a><a href=\"#creators\" style=\"color:#8EF2FE; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.76em; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.28); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; opacity:0.8;\">🎨 Creators</a><a href=\"#entrepreneurs\" style=\"color:#8EF2FE; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.76em; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.28); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; opacity:0.8;\">🚀 Entrepreneurs</a><a href=\"#how-to\" style=\"color:#8EF2FE; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.76em; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.28); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; opacity:0.8;\">⚡ Try This Week</a><a href=\"#quick-hits\" style=\"color:#8EF2FE; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.76em; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.28); border-radius:20px; padding:6px 14px; opacity:0.8;\">📌 Quick Hits</a></div>\n</div>\n<p>  <!-- Content --></p>\n<div style=\"background:rgba(142,242,254,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.22); border-left:4px solid #8EF2FE; border-radius:10px; padding:22px 28px 16px; margin-bottom:44px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:0.68em; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.15em; color:#8EF2FE; margin-bottom:14px;\">⚡ This Week in AI</div>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.7;\">It was a milestone week for practical AI, with a slew of new releases making tools faster, easier to use, and more business-ready than ever. Voice AI, automation, and smarter workflows are now directly reachable for teams and individuals—here’s what’s live right now.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:72px;\">\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.1); padding-top:32px; margin-bottom:28px;\">\n<h2 id=\"whats-new\" data-section=\"WHAT'S NEW\" style=\"margin:0; padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.78em; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#8EF2FE;\">🔥 WHAT&#8217;S NEW — 12 items</span></h2>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Gemini 3.1 Flash Live</strong>: Delivers highly natural, real-time audio AI for developers, enterprises, and everyday users, supporting voice-first agents that reliably handle complex dialogue and tasks in noisy environments. Best for: businesses and developers building conversational interfaces. <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-3-1-flash-live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>TurboQuant Algorithm (Google)</strong>: An AI compression technology reducing model memory needs by up to 6–8x and slashing costs in long-context tasks, with no loss in output quality. Best for: AI developers and businesses running large language models. <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/03/google-says-new-turboquant-compression-can-lower-ai-memory-usage-without-sacrificing-quality/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>IndexCache (Tsinghua University &amp; Z.ai)</strong>: New sparse attention optimizer that accelerates inference on long-context models by up to 1.82x, enabling faster responses with less hardware. Best for: organizations deploying or building long-context AI. <a href=\"https://venturebeat.com/technology/indexcache-a-new-sparse-attention-optimizer-delivers-1-82x-faster-inference\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>ChatGPT Product Discovery</strong>: ChatGPT now enables richer, visually immersive shopping using the Agentic Commerce Protocol—users can discover products, do side-by-side comparisons, and connect with merchant integrations. Best for: online shoppers and e-commerce businesses. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/powering-product-discovery-in-chatgpt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>OpenAI Safety Bug Bounty Program</strong>: A new reward program launched for reporting abuse, prompt injection, and data exfiltration vulnerabilities in OpenAI systems—open to the public for hands-on testing. Best for: security researchers and ethical hackers. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/safety-bug-bounty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>OpenAI Teen Safety Policies (gpt-oss-safeguard)</strong>: Developers gain prompt-based policies to moderate age-specific risks in AI systems, helping ensure safer experiences for teens. Best for: app developers building for a younger audience. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/teen-safety-policies-gpt-oss-safeguard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>EVA (Evaluating Voice Agents)</strong>: EVA is a new open-source framework scoring both accuracy and conversational experience in multi-turn voice AI, with an airline-focused dataset now available for benchmarking. Best for: anyone building or evaluating conversational voice agents. <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/ServiceNow-AI/eva\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Mistral AI Text-to-Speech (TTS) Release</strong>: Mistral claims its new TTS model exceeds ElevenLabs, releasing the model weights free for developers to use in their own voice applications. Best for: startups and projects needing high-quality, customizable voice synthesis. <a href=\"https://venturebeat.com/orchestration/mistral-ai-just-released-a-text-to-speech-model-it-says-beats-elevenlabs-and\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>OpenAI Foundation $1B+ Initiative</strong>: Foundation commits at least $1 billion toward curing diseases, expanding AI for public good, and boosting AI system resilience—meaning more resources soon available for community AI projects. Best for: nonprofits and researchers seeking collaboration or funding. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/update-on-the-openai-foundation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>STADLER’s ChatGPT Rollout</strong>: 230-year-old manufacturer STADLER has rolled out ChatGPT across 650 employees, transforming knowledge work and accelerating productivity at scale. Best for: enterprises looking for practical GenAI deployment examples. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/stadler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Intercom Fin Apex 1.0 Model</strong>: Intercom launches a proprietary AI model for customer service, reporting it surpasses leading models like GPT-5.4 and Claude Sonnet 4.6 in customer support tasks. Best for: SaaS platforms and customer service teams. <a href=\"https://venturebeat.com/technology/intercoms-new-post-trained-fin-apex-1-0-beats-gpt-5-4-and-claude-sonnet-4-6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Wispr Flow + Claude Cowork</strong>: Independents and small teams are now combining voice-to-text (Wispr Flow) and tailored Claude Cowork agents to write, edit, and structure complex documents via custom skills—freeing up hours of manual labor. Best for: creators and solo operators overwhelmed by writing/editing. <a href=\"https://wired.com/story/tech-reporters-using-ai-write-edit-stories/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:72px;\">\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.1); padding-top:32px; margin-bottom:28px;\">\n<h2 id=\"business\" data-section=\"AI FOR BUSINESS\" style=\"margin:0; padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.78em; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#a78bfa;\">💼 AI FOR BUSINESS — 8 items</span></h2>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>ChatGPT for Product Discovery</strong>: Businesses can leverage new visual shopping and merchant integration features to deliver immersive online shopping directly inside chat. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/powering-product-discovery-in-chatgpt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>STADLER x ChatGPT</strong>: Manufacturing companies can deploy ChatGPT organization-wide to streamline documentation, knowledge transfer, and internal communications, as seen at STADLER. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/stadler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Gemini 3.1 Flash Live in Gemini Enterprise</strong>: Customer experience teams can integrate real-time, natural-sounding voice AI into service platforms for faster, more effective client interactions—especially in call centers. <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-3-1-flash-live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Intercom Fin Apex 1.0</strong>: Customer success operations can implement a domain-specialized AI model tuned for support, offering potentially better resolution rates than leading general-purpose LLMs. <a href=\"https://venturebeat.com/technology/intercoms-new-post-trained-fin-apex-1-0-beats-gpt-5-4-and-claude-sonnet-4-6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Glia Banking AI Platform</strong>: Banks and credit unions can now automate up to 80% of client service tasks using an AI hub built for security and regulatory compliance. <a href=\"https://artificialintelligence-news.com/news/glia-wins-excellence-award-for-safer-ai-in-banking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Ocorian AI Insights</strong>: Family offices and wealth managers are using AI for anomaly detection, streamlined financial reporting, and regulatory compliance—boosting efficiency in daily ops. <a href=\"https://artificialintelligence-news.com/news/ocorian-family-offices-ai-for-financial-data-insights/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>AI Agents at Bank of America</strong>: Large banks are actively deploying AI agents (Salesforce Agentforce-based) to help financial advisers manage client relationships and workflows. <a href=\"https://artificialintelligence-news.com/news/ai-agents-enter-banking-roles-at-bank-of-america/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>JPMorgan AI Tracking</strong>: Enterprises can drive AI adoption by formally tracking employee AI use and tying engagement to performance reviews, as seen at JPMorgan. <a href=\"https://artificialintelligence-news.com/news/jpmorgan-begins-tracking-how-employees-use-ai-at-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:72px;\">\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.1); padding-top:32px; margin-bottom:28px;\">\n<h2 id=\"creators\" data-section=\"AI FOR CREATORS\" style=\"margin:0; padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.78em; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#f472b6;\">🎨 AI FOR CREATORS — 8 items</span></h2>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.13); border-left:4px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.45); line-height:1.7; background:rgba(142,242,254,0.03);\"><strong>Wispr Flow + Claude Cowork</strong>: Journalists and independent writers now streamline drafting and editing by combining AI voice-to-text and custom agent workflows, drastically reducing story creation time. <a href=\"https://wired.com/story/tech-reporters-using-ai-write-edit-stories/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; padding:20px 24px; ma