m:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.08);\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0; width:38px; height:38px; min-width:38px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(52,211,153,0.12); border:2px solid #34d399; color:#34d399; font-weight:800; font-size:0.85em; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">3</span>\n<div style=\"line-height:1.7; padding-top:8px; flex:1;\"><strong>Try Mistral’s TTS Model</strong>: Download the free model weights and synthesize your own text samples—see how natural your business or project’s next voiceover could sound.</div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:18px; padding:20px 0; margin-bottom:0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.08);\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0; width:38px; height:38px; min-width:38px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(52,211,153,0.12); border:2px solid #34d399; color:#34d399; font-weight:800; font-size:0.85em; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">4</span>\n<div style=\"line-height:1.7; padding-top:8px; flex:1;\"><strong>Run the EVA Benchmark</strong>: Download the EVA framework from HuggingFace and test your voice AI agent’s dialog quality and task completion versus available baselines.</div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:18px; padding:20px 0; margin-bottom:0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.08);\"><span style=\"flex-shrink:0; width:38px; height:38px; min-width:38px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(52,211,153,0.12); border:2px solid #34d399; color:#34d399; font-weight:800; font-size:0.85em; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">5</span>\n<div style=\"line-height:1.7; padding-top:8px; flex:1;\"><strong>Submit a Report to OpenAI’s Bug Bounty</strong>: Spend 10 minutes probing ChatGPT for prompt-injection or privacy issues to earn reputation (and maybe rewards).</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:72px;\">\n<div style=\"border-t