chestration/mistral-ai-just-released-a-text-to-speech-model-it-says-beats-elevenlabs-and\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; padding:12px 0; margin-bottom:0; line-height:1.7; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.1);\"><span style=\"color:#8EF2FE; flex-shrink:0; font-size:1.3em; line-height:1.3; margin-top:1px;\">›</span><span style=\"flex:1;\">The EVA framework is now live for joint evaluation of task accuracy and experience in voice agents. <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/ServiceNow-AI/eva\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; padding:12px 0; margin-bottom:0; line-height:1.7; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.1);\"><span style=\"color:#8EF2FE; flex-shrink:0; font-size:1.3em; line-height:1.3; margin-top:1px;\">›</span><span style=\"flex:1;\">OpenAI’s Safety Bug Bounty program has launched, inviting public security testing of their models. <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/safety-bug-bounty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size:0.7em; text-decoration:none; color:#8EF2FE; opacity:0.75; border:1px solid rgba(142,242,254,0.3); border-radius:4px; padding:2px 8px; margin-left:8px; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle;\">↗ source</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; padding:12px 0; margin-bottom:0; line-height:1.7; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,